    question: "What to eat for focus?",
    answer:
      "<p>Protein helps. Eggs, Greek yogurt, nuts. Keeps you full and stable. Complex carbs like oatmeal or whole grains provide sustained energy. Avoid high-sugar cereals and pastries. They cause crashes. Some people focus better fasting. Experiment. Hydration matters too. You wake up dehydrated. Water first.</p>",
  },
  {
